EXPLAIN
-> Aggregate: count(0)  (cost=12.6..12.6 rows=1)
    -> Filter: (t_big.id between 10 and 50)  (cost=0.207..8.47 rows=41)
        -> Covering index range scan on t_big using PRIMARY over (10 <= id <= 50)  (cost=0.107..4.37 rows=41)

