# B6 — AggregationPushDown: partial pushdown
# EXPLAIN:
EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE SELECT b.grp, SUM(a.val) FROM t_big a JOIN t_med b ON a.grp = b.grp GROUP BY b.grp ORDER BY b.grp;
EXPLAIN
-> Group vectorized aggregate: sum(a.val)
    -> Nested loop inner join
        -> Sort: b.grp
            -> Vectorized table scan on b in secondary engine Rapid
        -> Filter: (a.grp = b.grp)
